abstract: "Reproducible software, synthetic Smoke fixtures, governed external-input contracts, and validated reference outputs for historeceptomic analysis of ketamine, its enantiomers, metabolites, and psychoactive reference drugs. Verify and Full require user-supplied governed inputs. The release preserves missingness, compound identity, censored activity bounds, fixed-reference coordinates, and accepted numerical regression targets."
